---

Unlike the rest of this repository (dual MIT/Apache-2.0, see the top-level
LICENSE-MIT / LICENSE-APACHE), everything under this `m68k/` directory is
**MIT only**. This is a deliberate, narrower choice, not an oversight:
`docs/adr-0003-native-block-storage-doorbell-not-pio.md` requires it, so
that guest-side driver and boot ROM code stays usable by real MIRAGE
hardware and by Copperline plugins (proposal §16), neither of which can
take an Apache-2.0-encumbered dependency. Every source file under this
directory carries its own MIT header for the same reason -- so a file
copied out on its own still carries the right license without depending
on this notice traveling with it.
